 al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 23 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 31 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.995 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: El hecho de que muchos contratos estén cerca del límite no prueba que haya sido un error o que haya habido irregularidad. Puede deberse a razones legítimas, como necesidades específicas o precios del mercado.\nQué se puede revisar: Es importante comprobar si los contratos adjudicados en diciembre están relacionados entre sí. También se debe revisar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en áreas similares. Pueden haber razones legítimas para su repetición.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 52 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 4.0 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 13.0, with a 95% confidence interval of 7.6 to 23.0. Contract [1], for 14,995 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: a pile-up of amounts just under the limit is a statistical indicator. It does not prove that any contract was broken up or that anyone acted improperly; it may reflect market prices, fixed budgets or separate needs.\nWhat can be checked: in the linked contract files, what was bought in each case and on which dates, and whether several contracts meet a single need that could have been procured at once.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"plantilla","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["uT%2BaBBDlHFKqb7rCcv76BA%3D%3D","9IjCX6LZMpXECtSnloz%2BZQ%3D%3D","LC1%2FohBor80mMOlAXxDEjw%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}